{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Supper: New Blood",
    "steam_appid": 3032010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/90ce272a21a311311f4cb4faaaab6794.webp?t=1754376786\" width=641 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Supper: New Blood</i></strong> is a hilarious horror adventure game for fans of dark humor, bizarre puzzles, and exquisite food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stewie S. Appleton runs the remote Twin Sisters Motel in complete solitude. He has no family, no friends, and no hope for a better future. He has suffered all kinds of humiliation and abuse from a cruel world, but he\u2019s had enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by his family\u2019s culinary legacy, he will finally take justice into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Octavi Navarro (<strong><i>Thimbleweed Park</i></strong>, <strong><i>Photographs...</i></strong>) and Susanna Granell, creators of the critically acclaimed <strong><i>Midnight Scenes</i></strong><i> </i>series,\u00a0<strong><i>The Librarian</i></strong>, and\u00a0<strong><i>Unwelcome</i></strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>comes this crazy horror adventure game for fans of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guilty pleasure for the most exquisite palate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/1664d11aa8cbe319b83a4083b0974fc2.avif?t=1754376786\" width=600 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/d87ff925d4a829291b2bb3c65c5bcd04.webp?t=1754376786\" width=641 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshingly weird and macabre point-and-click adventure game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Stewie, a lonely soul who wants to make the world a better  his own way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Stewie fetch ingredients, solve funny, bizarre puzzles, and cook a delicious menu. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your guests' dark secrets, and then...choose your next victim! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty, colorful pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie original soundtrack and sound effects that will make your skin crawl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don\u2019t forget to pet Inferno. He\u2019s an orange cat, you know what that means. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready! The Twin Sisters Motel opens its doors for you!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/90ce272a21a311311f4cb4faaaab6794.webp?t=1754376786\" width=641 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Supper: New Blood</i></strong> is a hilarious horror adventure game for fans of dark humor, bizarre puzzles, and exquisite food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stewie S. Appleton runs the remote Twin Sisters Motel in complete solitude. He has no family, no friends, and no hope for a better future. He has suffered all kinds of humiliation and abuse from a cruel world, but he\u2019s had enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by his family\u2019s culinary legacy, he will finally take justice into his own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Octavi Navarro (<strong><i>Thimbleweed Park</i></strong>, <strong><i>Photographs...</i></strong>) and Susanna Granell, creators of the critically acclaimed <strong><i>Midnight Scenes</i></strong><i> </i>series,\u00a0<strong><i>The Librarian</i></strong>, and\u00a0<strong><i>Unwelcome</i></strong>,<i>\u00a0</i>comes this crazy horror adventure game for fans of the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A guilty pleasure for the most exquisite palate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/1664d11aa8cbe319b83a4083b0974fc2.avif?t=1754376786\" width=600 height=185 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032010/extras/d87ff925d4a829291b2bb3c65c5bcd04.webp?t=1754376786\" width=641 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refreshingly weird and macabre point-and-click adventure game. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Stewie, a lonely soul who wants to make the world a better  his own way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Stewie fetch ingredients, solve funny, bizarre puzzles, and cook a delicious menu. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate your guests' dark secrets, and then...choose your next victim! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tasty, colorful pixel art!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eerie original soundtrack and sound effects that will make your skin crawl.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And don\u2019t forget to pet Inferno. He\u2019s an orange cat, you know what that means. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready! The Twin Sisters Motel opens its doors for you!</p>",
    "short_description": "Do you hear the doorbell, Stewie? Your first guest is here...and something tells me they\u2019ll never leave the motel...",
